units.raw:
3.1 In consideration of the disclosure of Confidential Information, the Receiving Party covenants and agrees:
3.1.1 to preserve the confidentiality of all Confidential Information with the highest standard of professional care, and in any event with no lesser degree of diligence, vigilance and protection than that which it accords to its own proprietary trade secrets and confidential assets of a similar elevated nature;
3.1.2 to safeguard all tangible and digital embodiments of the Confidential Information against any unauthorised access, acquisition, theft, misappropriation, intrusion, transmission, copying or leak;
3.1.3 to refrain from disclosing, publishing, disseminating, or communicating the Confidential Information to any external third party, whether a legal entity or a natural person, without having secured the prior, formal, explicit and written authorisation of the Disclosing Party;
3.1.4 to restrict internal access to the Confidential Information strictly and exclusively to those of its own direct, permanent salaried employees who have an indispensable need to access such information for the sole accomplishment of the Permitted Purpose, and to ensure that such direct employees are bound by employment contracts or internal confidentiality undertakings imposing duties of secrecy and non-use no less rigorous than those set forth in this Agreement;
3.1.5 to not disclose, disseminate or make available the Confidential Information to any external professional advisers, legal counsel, accountants, auditors, insurers, independent contractors, consultants, or corporate Affiliates without the prior written authorisation of the Disclosing Party, the Parties acknowledging that disclosure to any such external third parties or Group companies requires specific prior consent; and
3.1.6 to refrain from disassembling, decompiling, decoding, reverse engineering, decrypting or attempting in any manner whatsoever to reconstruct, identify or derive the underlying design, logic, source code, data formats, trade secrets or operational algorithms of any software, binaries, libraries, cloud instances or technical assets provided under this Agreement.

